#
# The server's refusal of an OCITransStart on a session that logged on without
# the XA names: ORA-02048, Oracle 9.2.0.4 (#2807).
# Captured 2026-11-26 from an OCI 9.2 program (OCITransStart, OCITransDetach, OCITransPrepare,
# OCITransCommit and OCITransRollback, with XIDs of format 2807, gtrid
# 'gtrid' and a letter, bqual 'bq' and the same letter) run on the 9i VM
# (x86-64 Linux), under tcpdump.
# The TTC payload, without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the
# offset column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  04 01 00 00 00 01 00 00  00 00 00 08 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000010  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000020  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08  |................|
00000030  00 00 01 00 00 00 36 01  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |......6.........|
00000040  00 00 00 00 00 00 80 d0  d4 03 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000050  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000060  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000070  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 00 00 00 00 47 4f  52 41 2d 30 32 30 34 38  |......GORA-02048|
00000090  3a 20 61 74 74 65 6d 70  74 20 74 6f 20 62 65 67  |: attempt to beg|
000000a0  69 6e 20 64 69 73 74 72  69 62 75 74 65 64 20 74  |in distributed t|
000000b0  72 61 6e 73 61 63 74 69  6f 6e 20 77 69 74 68 6f  |ransaction witho|
000000c0  75 74 20 6c 6f 67 67 69  6e 67 20 6f 6e 0a        |ut logging on.|
000000ce
